{"scope":"knowledge/storyboard","page":3,"pageSize":24,"total":143,"totalPages":6,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-85f7a457edb3","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"黄金开场规则","description":"观众在前 5 秒决定是否继续观看。开场必须制造**即时冲突**或**强烈悬念**。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/opening-rules.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8a29d6a65558","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"原声蓝图格式示例","description":"以下是 `soundtrack-plan.md` 的标准格式。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/soundtrack-plan-example.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8b06289a8c21","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"付费卡点设计策略","description":"付费卡点是微短剧商业化的命脉。设计得好，观众觉得\"这钱花得值\"；设计得差，观众觉得\"被骗了\"然后弃剧。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/paywall-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8b2c9aa95168","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"剧情分析格式示例","description":"以下是 `analysis.md` 的标准格式。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/analysis-example.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8d3fe8b339bb","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"连续短剧的人物、切入与跨集记忆","description":"1. 使用方式与规则分级 2. 先建前史储备，再选叙事切入窗口 3. 用人物驱动力预测选择 4. 把人物变化写成可追踪的压力测试 5. 每集必须产生局部戏剧结果 6. 管理信息权限与铺垫债务 7. 用双轨节奏安排张弛 8. 建立可恢复的跨集记忆 9. 合成示例 10. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/serial-character-and-memory.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8d543649cd31","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"短剧对白方法","description":"1. 对白的工作定义与规则分级 2. 先写议程，再写句子 3. 台词是一种行动 4. 潜台词来自已知差与风险 5. 信息如何进入冲突 6. 人物声音如何区分 7. 让对话改变权力与关系 8. 动作、停顿、打断与沉默 9. 高密度对白场景 10. 对白修订流程 11. 合成示例 12. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/dialogue-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8d8941a667fa","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"场景空镜与地理保持","description":"场景空镜保持 accepted layout、orientation、fixed anchors、materials 与光向。 默认不带角色，以保持作为地理参考的复用性；只在创作者明确需要尺度参照 或剧情所有的 occupancy state 时加人。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/location-plate.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8f209c86c750","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"题材指南","description":"短剧的差异化竞争力来自题材叠加。规则：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/genre-guide.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-91c833af5a7e","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"爽点矩阵","description":"观众看微短剧的核心诉求就是\"爽\"。爽点设计得好，观众欲罢不能；设计得差，观众昏昏欲睡。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/satisfaction-matrix.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-93a38c68d81d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Fresh-agent Blind Forward Eval Protocol","description":"验证候选是否帮助新的 agent 在陌生题材中做出更好的创作判断，而不是验证它能否复述学习材料。 保持三类角色分离：候选作者、fresh-agent 执行者、independent reviewer。任何参与摘取、卡片合成或候选 写作的 agent 都不能担任最终 reviewer。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow/references/blind-forward-eval.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-knowhow","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-960216756bfa","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"通用资产图片提示词配方","description":"1. 目的与输入 2. 从资产事实到画面语言 3. 八段式配方 4. 锚点、约束与取舍 5. 输出、失败征兆与检查","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/common-recipe.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-98548a10deed","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"分镜时间轴 Prompt 格式（剧本 → 逐镜生成指令）","description":"> 把单集剧本拆成 5–6 个定时镜头，每镜写成一条「生成就绪」的 prompt。 > 格式借鉴 Seedance2-Storyboard-Generator 的时间轴写法，适配 Easel 的 ai-image-gen / ai-video-gen。 > 落盘为 `episodes/epNN/shots.json`，写完用 `drama_ops.py shots validate` 校验。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/shot-prompt-format.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-9980ba7eec41","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"常见场面的分镜方法：竖屏、单房、证据与群体轴线","description":"先使用镜头设计资料中的原文落实、镜头目的和场景地理方法。只有遇到下列场面时才读 本文；这些是思考步骤，不是镜头数量模板。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/blocking-playbooks.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-999eab3d7f03","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"题材条件与钩子手册","description":"这份参考资料来自对不同题材完整“剧本—资产—分镜—提示词修订”链的定性阅读。 它只保留可以用在新项目里的故事推进方法和常见问题，不保留项目名、原台词、内部 ID、原提示词、媒体 地址、供应商字段或题材频次。这里没有热度排名，也没有按标签自动套用的剧情公式。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/genre-and-hook-playbook.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-9a73c21aaea4","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"付费卡点设计策略","description":"付费卡点是微短剧商业化的命脉。设计得好，观众觉得\"这钱花得值\"；设计得差，观众觉得\"被骗了\"然后弃剧。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/paywall-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-9b213ac2c3ac","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"竖屏节奏（抖音/快手微短剧）","description":"> 竖屏短剧和横屏影视的节奏完全不同：小屏、外放、划走成本极低、常倍速看。 > 一切服务于「别让观众划走」。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/vertical-pacing.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a0f90f8d957b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"图片提示词阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有 `剧集/<EP>/图片提示词.md` 中的 `IMG-...` 项：用途、参考边界和可复制正文。它继承 视觉设定与项目视觉方向，不改写资产身份、地理、剧情状态或镜头边界。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a6953f1dc6e9","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"单集跨上下文交接胶囊","description":"长单集因为上下文限制需要分批续写时，可以在**当前会话上下文**维护一份最小交接摘要。它不落盘、 不成为第六份创作文档，也不替代 `剧本.md`。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/scene-handoff-capsule.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a78da0d51e3a","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Evidence-Based Review Method","description":"Start from the current creator-visible files and the constraints the creator has explicitly chosen. Prefer an uninvolved reviewer or isolated context when available; otherwise perform an honest self-check and say so in the review Markdown.…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/review-method.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a8666e8f5cd5","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"镜头设计方法","description":"1. [先落实原文，再追求画面](#先落实原文再追求画面) 2. [镜头目的](#镜头目的) 3. [场面调度与地理](#场面调度与地理) 4. [景别与摄影机动机](#景别与摄影机动机) 5. [时长与切镜](#时长与切镜) 6. [常见问题](#常见问题) 7. [审查问题](#审查问题)","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/shot-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a8ac2c40dd86","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"Assets And Asset-Image Prompt Rubric","description":"without guessing?","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/rubric-assets-prompts.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-a8e5b846af9e","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"关键场景 Coverage Audition","description":"Coverage audition 在正式 shots 前比较真正不同的导演方案，避免第一种合理做法直接成为唯一答案。 它不是固定镜头数、固定宫格或自动变体器；创作者选择之后才投影为正式场次视觉计划和 shots。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/coverage-audition.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-aaaeba384778","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"表演弧、动作预算与节奏","description":"表演和故事变化是否仍可读，不套通用“每秒几个动词”公式。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/performance-action-timing.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-aba3b9545976","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"目标模型能力档案","description":"本套件的模型相关规则一律写成“按目标模型确认”，但“确认”在实践中经常没有落点：没人知道要确认 哪几件事，于是提示词按最保守的写法交出去，执行端再靠自己补——补出来的往往就是漂移。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","sour